/**
 * Tests for the Jev routing seam (lib/route-judgment, lib/route-classes).
 *
 * HTTP is always a mocked fetch or a mocked spawn; the one real child
 * process test talks to a loopback server. No test reaches the network.
 *
 * Validates:
 * - the class set and its executor map (ops classes and the two never-steered
 *   classes map to null; every dev class maps to an executor)
 * - the redactor: one case per pattern, the JSON escaped form, client slugs
 *   from directory names including the spaced form and segments
 * - the egress guard refuses a leak the redactor did not catch
 * - fail open paths: no key, timeout, non-2xx, malformed body, below floor
 * - the balance guard: daily token budget, and the 402 / 429 trip
 * - the record: mode 0600, no prompt text, sha of the redacted text
 * - the synchronous child transport protocol
 * - the log line shape
 */

